<title>ROMANIA: Turnover halves on the Bucharest bourse.</title>
<headline>Turnover halves on the Bucharest bourse.</headline>
<text>
<p>1330 GMT - Turnover on the Bucharest bourse on Tuesday sagged to 27 million lei, or half the previous session's level, in thin investor interest.</p>
<p>* Volume slipped to 3,760 shares from 5,757 last Thursday.</p>
<p>* Seven prices rose, five fell, two remained unchanged and one stock had no trade.</p>
<p>* Syringe maker Sanevit SA and insulator maker</p>
<p>Electroceramica SA were suspended pending</p>
<p>announcements.</p>
